 75, 77, 78, 79 SA/NSA/Sub6 - A3719</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"tr-toggle\">\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=3g\">Speed</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"speed\">HSPA, LTE, 5G</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\" scope=\"row\">Launch</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=phone-life-cycle\">Announced</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"year\">2026, September 09</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=phone-life-cycle\">Status</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"status\">Coming soon. Exp. release 2026, October 23</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"6\" scope=\"row\">Body</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"helpW('h_dimens.htm');\">Dimensions</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"dimensions\">Unfolded: 117.8 x 164.6 x 5.2 mm<br/>Folded: 117.8 x 84.1 x 11.3 mm</td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"helpW('h_weight.htm');\">Weight</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"weight\">254 g (8.96 oz)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=build\">Build</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"build\">Glass front (Ceramic Shield 2) (folded), titanium frame &amp; hindge (grade 5), glass back (Ceramic Shield)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=sim\">SIM</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"sim\">· <a href=\"glossary.php3?term=esim\">eSIM</a> + eSIM (8 or more, max 2 at a time) - Global<br/>· eSIM + eSIM (China)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ttl\"> </td><td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"bodyother\">IP68 dust tight and water resistant (immersible up to 6m for 30 min)<br>\r\nStylus support</br></td></tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"5\" scope=\"row\">Display</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=display-type\">Type</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"displaytype\">LTPO Super Retina XDR OLED, 120Hz, HDR10, Dolby Vision, 1000 nits (typ), 1600 nits (HBM), 3000 nits (peak)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"helpW('h_dsize.htm');\">Size</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"displaysize\">7.6 inches, 175.4 cm<sup>2</sup> (~90.4% screen-to-body ratio)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=resolution\">Resolution</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"displayresolution\">1878 x 2670 pixels (~430 ppi density)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=screen-protection\">Protection</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"displayprotection\">Nano Texture finish</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ttl\"> </td><td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"displayother\">Anti‑reflective coating<br>\r\nWide-angle OLED matte display<br>\r\nSmall display crease<br>\n<br>\r\nCover display:<br>\r\nLTPO Super Retina XDR OLED, 120Hz, HDR10, Dolby Vision, 1000 nits (typ), 1600 nits (HBM), 3000 nits (peak)<br>\r\n5.4 inches, 1398 x 2034 pixels, 460 ppi<br>\r\nCeramic Shield 2, Anti‑reflective coating</br></br></br></br></br></br></br></td></tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"4\" scope=\"row\">Platform</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=os\">OS</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"os\">iOS 27</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=chipset\">Chipset</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"chipset\">Apple A20 Pro (2 nm)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=cpu\">CPU</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"cpu\">Hexa-core (2x GHz high performance + 4x GHz)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=gpu\">GPU</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"gpu\">Apple GPU (7-core graphics)</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"5\" scope=\"row\">Memory</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=memory-card-slot\">Card slot</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"memoryslot\">No</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=dynamic-memory\">Internal</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"internalmemory\">256GB 12GB RAM, 512GB 12GB RAM, 1TB 12GB RAM, 2TB 12GB RAM</td>\n</tr>\n\n\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"small-line-height\" rowspan=\"4\" scope=\"row\">Main Camera</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=camera\">Dual</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"cam1modules\">48 MP, f/1.6, 26mm (wide), 1/1.56\", 1.0µm, PDAF, sensor-shift OIS<br>\r\n48 MP, f/2.2, 13mm, 120˚ (ultrawide), 1/2.55\", 0.7µm, PDAF</br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=camera\">Features</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"cam1features\">Dual-LED dual-tone flash, HDR (photo/panorama)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=camera\">Video</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"cam1video\">4K@24/25/30/60/100/120fps, 1080p@25/30/60/120/240fps, 10-bit HDR, Dolby Vision HDR (up to 120fps), ProRes, 3D (spatial) video/audio, stereo sound rec.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"small-line-height\" rowspan=\"4\" scope=\"row\">Selfie camera</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=secondary-camera\">Single</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"cam2modules\">XX MP under display camera, f/1.8, 1080p@30/60fps video<br>\r\nCover camera:<br>\r\n12 MP multi-aspect, f/2.2, (wide), AF</br></br></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=secondary-camera\">Features</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"cam2features\">HDR, Dolby Vision HDR, spatial audio, stereo sound rec.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=secondary-camera\">Video</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"cam2video\">4K@24/25/30/60fps, 1080p@25/30/60/120fps, gyro-EIS</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"3\" scope=\"row\">Sound</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=loudspeaker\">Loudspeaker</a> </td>\n<td class=\"nfo\">Yes, with stereo speakers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=audio-jack\">3.5mm jack</a> </td>\n<td class=\"nfo\">No</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"9\" scope=\"row\">Comms</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=wi-fi\">WLAN</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"wlan\">Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/6e/7, tri-band, hotspot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=bluetooth\">Bluetooth</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"bluetooth\">6.0, A2DP, LE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=gnss\">Positioning</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"gps\">GPS (L1+L5), GLONASS, GALILEO, BDS, QZSS, NavIC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=nfc\">NFC</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"nfc\">Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=fm-radio\">Radio</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"radio\">No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=usb\">USB</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"usb\">USB Type-C 3.2 Gen 2, DisplayPort</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"9\" scope=\"row\">Features</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=sensors\">Sensors</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"sensors\">Fingerprint (side-mounted), accelerometer, gyro, proximity, compass, barometer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td class=\"ttl\"> </td><td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"featuresother\">Ultra Wideband (UWB) support (gen2 chip)<br/>\r\nEmergency SOS, Messages and Find My via satellite</td></tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"7\" scope=\"row\">Battery</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=rechargeable-battery-types\">Type</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"batdescription1\">Li-Ion</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=battery-charging\">Charging</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\">Wired, PD3.2, AVS, 50% in 20 min<br/>\r\n25W wireless MagSafe/Qi2, 50% in 30 min</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"6\" scope=\"row\">Misc</th>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=build\">Colors</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"colors\">Night Sky, Star White</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=models\">Models</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"models\">A3720, A3721, A3447, A3719</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"glossary.php3?term=price\">Price</a></td>\n<td class=\"nfo\" data-spec=\"price\">About 2300 EUR</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"note\"><strong>Disclaimer.</strong> We can not guarantee that the information on this page is 100% correct. <a href=\"glossary.php3?term=data-disclaimer\">Read more</a></p>\n<div class=\"article-info-line page-specs light\">\n<ul class=\"article-info-meta\">\n<li class=\"article-info-meta-link light\"><a href=\"apple_iphone_duo_fold-pictures-13804.php\"><i class=\"head-icon icon-pictures\"></i>Pictures</a></li>\n<li class=\"article-info-meta-link light\"><a href=\"compare.php3?idPhone1=13804\"><i class=\"head-icon icon-mobile-phone231 icon-compare\"></i>Compare</a></li>\n<li class=\"article-info-meta-link light\" title=\"Apple iPhone Duo user reviews and opinions\"><a href=\"apple_iphone_duo_fold-reviews-13804.php\"><i class=\"head-icon icon-comment-count\"></i>Opinions</a></li>\n<br style=\"clear:both;\"/>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"box s3 nobg\" id=\"user-comments\">\n<h2><a href=\"apple_iphone_duo_fold-reviews-13804.php\">Apple iPhone Duo - user opinions and reviews</a></h2>\n<div class=\"user-thread\">\n<div class=\"uavatar\"><span class=\"avatar-box\" style=\"background-color: #db80ea\">M</span></div>\n<ul class=\"uinfo2\">\n<li class=\"uname2\">Milo</li>\n<li class=\"ulocation\">\n<i class=\"head-icon icon-location\"></i>\n<span title=\"Encoded anonymized locatio